It's very unlikely to ever be an issue, but to ensure that you've got all the entries, I think it would be good to check that there's no `marker` in the result.
```
            auto const result = env.rpc(
                "json", "ledger_data", to_string(params))[jss::result];
            BEAST_EXPECT(!result.isMember(jss::marker));
            return result;
```
